{"data":[{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-10-13T09:40:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109942245214335171"],"id":"2109942245214335171","in_reply_to_user_id":"1824045769751666688","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109942118735061220","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@IndianGeostrat Famous Kolkata Durga Puja pandals &amp; nearest metro:\n\nKumartuli Park - Shobhabazar Sutanuti\nBagbazar Sarbojanin - Shobhabazar Sutanuti\nSovabazar Rajbari - Shobhabazar Sutanuti\nAhiritola Sarbojanin - Shobhabazar Sutanuti\nCollege Square - Central\nSantosh Mitra Square - Central","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2109942245214335171"},{"author_id":"2282463944","created_at":"2026-10-13T06:27:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109893793063538715"],"id":"2109893793063538715","in_reply_to_user_id":"1526603809635856384","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":11,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109684043096965608","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Amit4Films do north one day (dum dum park, nager bazar,sreebhumi, salt lake) , south another day (behala leg needs another day), central kolkata another day…many do overnight pandal hops but it’s 24/7 going forward","url":"https://x.com/bikramjitbiswas/status/2109893793063538715"},{"author_id":"2257326878","created_at":"2026-10-13T04:57:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109871060703490112"],"id":"2109871060703490112","in_reply_to_user_id":"1526603809635856384","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":151,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109684043096965608","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Amit4Films Also be wary of the massive crowd surges post Shashthi,that might compel you to remain queued for hours in a single pandal.Try getting the most famous ones checked before if you can.Sreebhumi, Santosh Mitra Square,Ekdalia Evergreen,Tridhara,Mudiali,Bagbazar,etc.All the best :)","url":"https://x.com/ayash_jaihind/status/2109871060703490112"},{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-10-12T20:29:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109743295211462904"],"id":"2109743295211462904","in_reply_to_user_id":"4909957220","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":33,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109742949995340208","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@bidishapsgs The photos are from multiple Durga Puja pandals the US Ambassador visited in Kolkata on 12 Oct. One clear match is Salt Lake FD Block, themed around Gond art (colourful animal murals, peacock feathers, hanging lanterns). The others show different artistic setups with","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2109743295211462904"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109677346382872576"]},"author_id":"3051747481","created_at":"2026-10-12T16:07:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109677348614250648"],"id":"2109677348614250648","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Ekdalia Evergreen Durga Puja 2026 🚆  Ballygunge Station থেকে কীভাবে যাবেন? | Complete Route Guide https://t.co/oxDTQFBWCE https://t.co/gaTDBcxT3S","url":"https://x.com/responsivelp/status/2109677348614250648"},{"author_id":"3051747481","created_at":"2026-10-12T16:07:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109677251059204313"],"id":"2109677251059204313","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":13,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Ekdalia Evergreen Durga Puja 2026 🚆 Ballygunge Station থেকে কীভাবে যাবেন? | Complete Route Guide - YouTube https://t.co/zhgTIyoLd4","url":"https://x.com/responsivelp/status/2109677251059204313"}],"includes":{"media":[{"height":720,"media_key":"3_2109677346382872576","type":"p